Package: mmdb
Version: 0.0.0
Section: net
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: Mslm Dev <support@internetdata.io>
Homepage: https://github.com/internetdata/mmdb
Description: Read, import, export, diff and verify MMDB files
 Read the data for IPs, CIDRs and ranges from an MMDB file, build one from
 CSV, TSV or JSON, export one back to those formats, see the difference
 between two, print a file's metadata, and check that one is well formed.
